flowchart LR
    subgraph Clients[Client and terminal processes]
        CLI[PTAS terminal workflow]
        DASH[Read-only recommendation dashboard]
        API_CLIENT[Swagger or API client]
    end

    subgraph API[FastAPI application]
        ROUTES[Routes and Pydantic schemas]
        CONTROLLERS[Controllers]
        USECASES[Use cases]
        REPOSITORIES[Repositories]
        SERVICES[Application services]
    end

    subgraph Integrations[Local and optional integrations]
        NMAP[Nmap service]
        SERVICE_TOOLS[Bounded service-aware tools]
        EXPLOITDB[Local Exploit-DB search]
        OLLAMA[Optional local Ollama advisor]
        LAB[Verified Metasploitable 2 lab service]
        REPORT_RENDERER[JSON and HTML report renderer]
    end

    DB[(SQLAlchemy configured database)]

    CLI -->|HTTP through PTASApiClient| ROUTES
    API_CLIENT --> ROUTES
    ROUTES --> CONTROLLERS
    CONTROLLERS --> USECASES
    USECASES --> REPOSITORIES
    REPOSITORIES --> DB
    USECASES --> SERVICES

    SERVICES --> NMAP
    SERVICES --> OLLAMA
    SERVICES --> LAB
    CLI --> SERVICE_TOOLS
    CLI --> EXPLOITDB
    CLI --> REPORT_RENDERER
    SERVICE_TOOLS --> DB
    EXPLOITDB --> DB
    REPORT_RENDERER --> DB

    CLI -->|Session events and terminal transcript| DASH
    DASH -->|Validated guidance only| CLI
